# WeKan.AI — ICP (DRAFT SKELETON — not canonical yet)

*Seeded 2026-08-31 by inference from `company.md` and `positioning.md`. **This is not research.** Every section below is an internal assumption, not evidence. Run `/icp-research https://wekancode.com` to replace it, ideally after `/win-loss-analysis`.*

